---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor SDD_SEQ_11_LD as L and D Manager
  participant SDD_SEQ_11_Finance as Finance use case
  participant SDD_SEQ_11_Report as Report use case
  participant SDD_SEQ_11_Policy as ROI policy
  participant SDD_SEQ_11_DB as Approved finance / evidence<br/>persistence
  SDD_SEQ_11_LD->>SDD_SEQ_11_Finance: record cost/benefit with period, currency and basis
  SDD_SEQ_11_Finance->>SDD_SEQ_11_Finance: authorize organization, validate fields/revision
  SDD_SEQ_11_Finance->>SDD_SEQ_11_DB: commit actual record and audit
  SDD_SEQ_11_LD->>SDD_SEQ_11_Report: department, job position, period filters
  SDD_SEQ_11_Report->>SDD_SEQ_11_DB: scoped evidence and comparable financial records
  SDD_SEQ_11_Report->>SDD_SEQ_11_Policy: calculate from selected actual inputs
  alt valid positive costs and comparable currency
  SDD_SEQ_11_Policy-->>SDD_SEQ_11_Report: (benefits - costs) / costs * 100
  else zero cost / missing input / unsupported mixed currency
  SDD_SEQ_11_Policy-->>SDD_SEQ_11_Report: explicit not-calculable reason
  end
  SDD_SEQ_11_Report-->>SDD_SEQ_11_LD: totals, provenance, period and result status
